N1  - Cochrane systematic review and meta-analysis of RCTs and quasi-RCTs (search to 4 April 2016; update of the 2002 review). 7 studies were eligible and 5 provided data (4,798 participants). Primary outcome, at least one adenoma: 5 RCTs, n=3,641. Colorectal cancer: 2 RCTs, n=2,794.. Not verified 2026-10-14. Used for: nutrition.fibre_intake_target: context
